# dsscat (CScattershotProjectile, PortCScattershotProjectile.cpp): rooftop boss u04f7 (Sanctuary
# 10_cliff_rooftop layer 2). Scatter shots with the player on the ledge (shots end on the world),
# next to the boss (shots hit the player) and at a middle distance; MovingScatterShot adds shots
# to a live projectile from the side step.
@f600 send u04f7 Activate; god 1
@f650 fsm u04f7 ScatterShot
@f850 fsm u04f7 ScatterShot
@f1050 place u04f7 player 4
@f1080 fsm u04f7 ScatterShot
@f1280 fsm u04f7 MovingScatterShot
@f1480 place u04f7 player 14
@f1500 fsm u04f7 ScatterShot
@f1700 fsm u04f7 MovingScatterShot
@f1900 status
